# RO's shape (RO_0002029): an idle data property whose range is a
# DatatypeRestriction. The range is inert, and the restriction's blank-node
# tree goes with it: no AnonymousIndividual and no ReservedVocabulary lines
# for its internals. COHERENT (exit 0).

@prefix :     <http://example.org/t#> .
@prefix owl:  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdf:  <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd:  <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

<http://example.org/t> a owl:Ontology .
:A a owl:Class .
:pct a owl:DatatypeProperty ; rdfs:domain :A ;
    rdfs:range [ a rdfs:Datatype ; owl:onDatatype xsd:short ;
                 owl:withRestrictions ( [ xsd:minInclusive 0 ] [ xsd:maxInclusive 100 ] ) ] .
